    i18n review summary for ai / memory / transformer modules:
    - ai module (standalone Gradle module): user-visible error messages are delivered
      to UI via Result.Error/exceptions, but cannot reference app's R.string directly.
      Each source file is annotated with // TODO i18n pending extraction; extraction
      requires an error-code enum approach.
